+#: identity control below rebuilds the FS1 body with its unchanged codes and
+#: refuses unless the bytes come back identical, which is what proves it.
+#: (ck2_carrier_plane2, brotli quality, brotli lgwin)
+FS2_CONTAINER_OPTIONS: tuple[tuple[bool, int, int], ...] = ((False, 9, 16),)
